    These slides intentionally use the current vis-* compatibility layer so they
    match the modern SANS/Zenable decks while the primitive migration described
    in AGENTS.md is still underway. -#}

{%- macro use_cases() -%}
<section class="vis-slide" data-label="Loops" style="position:relative; overflow:hidden;">
