      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">Compute efficiency</p>
      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">Logs &rarr; bug fixes</p>
      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">Goal-based development</p>
      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">User feedback &rarr; features</p>
      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">Documentation grooming</p>
      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">Integration verification</p>
      <p style="font-size:34px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin:0;">Add database indexes</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
